        "description": "A modern GUI tool for quick GitHub deployment with full branch management support.\n\nKey Features:\n• Automatic Git repository initialization\n• Encrypted token storage\n• Commit message history\n• Multiple branch support (create, switch, delete, merge)\n• Automatic .gitignore generation\n• Modern Material Design interface\n• Keyboard shortcuts support\n\nRequirements:\n• Git installed (git-scm.com)\n• Python 3.6+\n• cryptography package (optional)",
