        "help": {
            "title": "Help",
            "content": "<h2> GitHub Deploy Helper v3.0 - Help</h2>\n\n<h3> Basic Usage:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Select your project folder</li>\n<li>Enter GitHub repository URL</li>\n<li>Paste your GitHub token (needs 'repo' scope)</li>\n<li>Select or create a branch</li>\n<li>Choose a commit message</li>\n<li>Click DEPLOY or press F5</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3> Branch Management:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Create</b> - Create new branch from existing one</li>\n<li><b>Switch</b> - Change current working branch</li>\n<li><b>Delete</b> - Remove unwanted branches</li>\n<li><b>Merge</b> - Merge one branch into another</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>⌨ Keyboard Shortcuts:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>F5</b> - Start deployment</li>\n<li><b>Ctrl+O</b> - Select project folder</li>\n<li><b>Ctrl+Q</b> - Exit application</li>\n<li><b>F1</b> - Show this help</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3> GitHub Token:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Create token at: <b>github.com/settings/tokens</b></li>\n<li>Required scope: <b>repo</b> (full control)</li>\n<li>Token is saved encrypted on your machine</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3> Tips:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Commit history is automatically saved</li>\n<li>.gitignore is auto-generated for common files</li>\n<li>Log can be exported for debugging</li>\n<li>Token can be checked and managed in Settings</li>\n</ul>"
        },
